      <section eId="sec_1-101">
        <num>1-101</num>
        <heading>Northern Mariana Islands: Defined</heading>
        <paragraph eId="sec_1-101__para_1" class="indent-1">
          <content>
            <p>The “Northern Mariana Islands” means the area formerly known as the Mariana Islands District of the Trust Territory of the Pacific Islands, which lies within the area north of 14 degrees north latitude, south of 21 degrees north latitude, west of 150 degrees east longitude and east of 144 degrees east longitude.</p>
          </content>
        </paragraph>
      </section>
